            <note corresp="#d525-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d525-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated to Tel Aviv, New York, London, Paris, Ankara, Amman, Baghdad, Beirut,
                    Cairo, Jidda, and Jerusalem.</p>
            </note>
